Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:53.92,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So the next thing is to come up with a better team name-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.53,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Golden opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:03:00.24,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We too will Go get fired up so we don't lag behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.30,Default,Dorna,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.04,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's join this match together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:08.11,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,AlomageDressing Parfait sounds nice too-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:10.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It should be Dresslomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.52,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Kinda tough to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:14.94,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumama! Don't make your decision so hastily-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:20.48,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The team who wins the GrandPrix will be given the SDPC-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.43,Default,Dorna,0,0,0,,The SDPC!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:24.79,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.36,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The SDPC, also known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:31.41,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,...the Summer Dream Parade Coord-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:35.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:41.38,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The ladies who wear it become the Princesses of Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,When you say summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:48.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,does that mean there are also autumn and winter ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.59,0:03:51.26,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,You sure are perceptive-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:55.49,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Once the Princesses of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter have been chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:59.23,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,the Princess of Seasons will be chosen when the Coord of Seasons appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:02.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The Princess of Seasons?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:03.78,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Sounds wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.60,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:09.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll be the Demon Princess of Summer if I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.78,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Pudding is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.16,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.07,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Put everything you've got into it-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That was my line-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.62,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,Psh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:20.33,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,My Dressing Parfait will take the lead this time-usa.{be ahead this time-usa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:23.42,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No way you'll be able to win\Nagainst a cool bear like me-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.42,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,Just what's cool about you-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.51,Default,Usa,0,0,0,,If it's cool you're looking for, I win-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:30.17,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm way above cool-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:31.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm elite-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:33.96,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm all soft and fluffy-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.89,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,My little sister is way cuter-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.89,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma Kuma Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.89,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa Usa Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:42.00,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wait, you have a little sister-kuma?\NThat's news to me-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.03,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.15,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,My little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.11,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.04,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's right, she calls me Nii-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:50.82,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:53.33,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.08,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Are you okay, cute young lass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:04.30,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.84,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:08.63,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:11.17,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.07,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha! Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.33,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,It's been so long-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.70,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I missed you-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:23.56,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,My cute little sister{ imouto} Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:25.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Usagi-san's little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:27.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,They look nothing like each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.75,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What a broad smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.28,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So that's what Usagi-san looks like when he smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.69,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:36.74,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:38.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:42.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha, what happened to mascot school-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:45.21,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Mascots don't do well in humidity-ucha,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.79,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,so school's out for the rainy season-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.46,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,That makes sense-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.68,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,School... That brings back memories-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.89,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,You were an honour roll student, after all-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:56.03,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's not worth mentioning-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.72,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,So why are you here, Usacha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:04.94,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I came to see my cool, elite, beautiful,\Nand beloved Nii-cha-ucha!{my heart hngggg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:08.12,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha, you truly are a cute little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:11.68,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead and introduce yourself to everyone-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:22.98,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,SoLaMi Smile-chama, Dressing Parfait-chama, Alomagedon-chama, Neko-chama,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.34,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,nice to meetcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.63,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I'm Nii-cha's little sister, Usacha-ucha!{>_>}{83}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,So cute!{2 exclamation marks too much?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.55,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,And 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:40.47,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Dorthy, you were a bit late on that turn-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:41.39,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.94,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I wasn't late; Shion was just early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.73,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Less complaining, more dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.88,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll be able to beat SoLaMi Smile like that-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.32,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Once more from the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:54.53,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,And 1, 2, 1, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.93,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's gotten into Usagi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:07:02.46,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:06:58.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,He's more fired up than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:02.46,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,As the older brother, he wants to show his little sister his good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What a hopeless idiot... {can't help it}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.41,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Move your arms and legs, not your mouth-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You answer with a "Yes, sir"-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.17,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yes, sir-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:13.65,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,You don't need to include the "usa"-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:14.63,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha is so cool-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.35,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,After that, handling the schedule is also an important job of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:23.92,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,When it comes to Nii-cha, instead of having it down to the minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.96,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I've got the schedule memorized down to the second-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.75,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,This'll be a great experience{ for Usacha}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.61,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Usacha wants to become an Elite Manager just like Nii-cha-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:33.82,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Is that so-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.44,0:07:37.78,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuman! Kuma-kuman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:36.64,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.11,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:40.26,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Move to the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:43.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now up... No, more like diagonal... More!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:44.68,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.31,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Is this where it itches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:49.46,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Want me to use my nails this time-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yes! There, right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.58,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:55.72,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Men sure are cute-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.18,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,In broad daylight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.27,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Playing with just him...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:02.55,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm so freakin jeal{\fscx300}-{jelly?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:05.02,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,That's kind of gross{vulgar}-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.52,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course{you're right}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:09.24,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm so jeal... err, it {\i1}is{\i0} uncool-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:11.32,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha would never do that-ucha!{You're completely different-ucha.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.03,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,All right, Usacha, let's get going-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:24.67,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Now then, Nii-cha has a few important tasks to take care of-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:27.36,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It would be great if you waited for me right here-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:28.95,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Got it-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:30.85,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'll be back shortly-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.92,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:37.22,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha is really cool-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.64,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I want to be just like him-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:44.05,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wow! Neko-neesan was incredible-kuma! {orgasmic = too lewd?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:44.72,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.92,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Usacha, what are you doing-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:52.36,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for my Elite Manager Nii-cha to finish up with his work-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.28,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Work-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.24,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ah!{oh god why}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:09:00.80,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma-oniichama has something good he'd like to show you-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:01.70,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:04.70,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything you can do-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.95,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm begging you-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.59,0:09:10.12,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please apply by the entry deadline next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:14.20,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,As young and passionate idols, sometimes Dressing Parfait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:17.79,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,...has trouble agreeing about the details of their concert-usa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.18,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,At times like that, it's pretty normal to be a little late{ with their entry}-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.68,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Even then, you shouldn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.39,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please let them-usa. I'm begging you-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.34,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please-usa! Please-usa! Usa! Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.07,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Is this the good thing-ucha?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yep-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:33.81,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumamamama...{I'm like 95% sure this is a evil kuma laugh} {kufufu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:38.06,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I won't forgive Usagi for being the only one with such a cute little sister-kuma!{It's unforgivable that only Usagi has such a cute little sister-kuma.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now your little sister will see who{how} you really are-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:44.58,Default-Alt,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I can't break the system's rules.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.03,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please-usa!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.20,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,He's bowing so much... {so shameless?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.75,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Profuse perspiration!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.24,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It means your body is dripping with sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.68,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,If you don't {properly }wipe it off, you'll catch a cold-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:55.17,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hey, what about my massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:55.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:57.20,Default,Dorhty,0,0,0,,Come on and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.03,Default,Dorhty,0,0,0,,My muscles are starting to get sore.{hurt}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:09:59.67,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.18,0:10:02.15,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,My shirt frayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:04.36,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Idols can't have worn-out clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.64,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'll fix it right away-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:06.70,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,Profuse perspiration!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.51,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Right-usa!
