Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:09.21,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Right-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.54,Default-Alt,Leona,0,0,0,,This string!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:11.60,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Right-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.11,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kumakumakuma!
