Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:24.12,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Did you see something good-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.12,0:10:25.23,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Kuma-chama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:26.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:27.91,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,That was really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:29.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.26,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,That was really good-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:33.67,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Thanks-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:40.51,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,For their precious idols, managers... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:46.43,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Anyway, Niicha will lower his head, massage, and sew for Dressing Parfait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.43,0:10:49.58,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,He's always working so hard-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.43,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:51.59,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Usacha knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:54.59,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,He's an unsung hero-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:56.40,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha is so cool-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I-Is that right-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.98,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Then that's great-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.98,0:11:01.82,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It was worth showing you-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:05.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I accidentally raised Usagi's stock-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:07.66,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's right-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.28,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let me show you something even cooler about him-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.12,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:15.08,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Just take this and do this-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:19.67,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha, sorry for taking so long-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:20.75,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,She's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.49,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Where'd she go-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:24.26,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:29.41,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nekon. Neko-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:30.82,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Neko-neesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.82,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Aw, doing it in a place like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:35.23,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You're so bold, Neko-neesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.48,0:11:38.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Neko-neesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.78,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Kuchi kuchi kuchi kuchi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.58,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.99,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I'll reward you with peanuts-nekon. {ahahahahaahha}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:47.38,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa! Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:56.39,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So, Usagi, what are you doing-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:57.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,U... {\alpha&HFF&}sa....{alpha?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:58.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,U... sa....{alpha?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:04.38,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.59,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:13.56,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,This Nii-cha is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:16.27,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,...so not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.73,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:21.87,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.87,0:12:24.40,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma! Kuma kuma kuma kuma kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of this-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:39.07,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong-usa!{No-usa. This is a missunderstanding-usa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:40.58,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.92,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I hate you-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.18,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:46.59,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha! Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Usacha-chan, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.55,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Are you running from Usagi-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:55.06,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa... usa... usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:57.34,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I was just having a little fun-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:59.52,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I thought it was Neko-neesan, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:02.31,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I don't like this-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.31,0:13:05.71,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha was someone Usacha admired-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:09.38,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,And for Nii-cha to do something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.49,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,I never wanted to see it-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.43,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Something so horrible? {like that}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:14.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.75,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,You're terrible-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry-usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:21.70,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Smile smile! Kuma kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:25.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Usagi is the worst-kumakumakuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:30.13,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,K-Kumamama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.57,0:13:32.30,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:34.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let me explain! Please hear me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:35.81,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma was in the wrong-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:38.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So, hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.65,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I was just teasing them a little-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:47.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why would you do something so mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:50.98,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I don't care if you do it to Usagi-san, but I feel bad for Usacha-chan.{it's like it's okay if you do it to Usagi-san, but I feel sorry for Usachachan}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:52.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.31,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I wanted one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.46,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We can't hear you-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:03.35,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:05.25,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:09.42,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:12.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a little sister-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.64,Default,kuma-nee,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:15.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:18.84,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's not fair that Usagi has such a cute little sister-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:20.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I've always wanted a little sister-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:22.23,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:22.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's Go{ and leave him alone}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:23.98,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:24.57,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:25.77,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.22,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's get going, Leona.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:29.23,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:35.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So it was paper-mâché...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:47.00,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:50.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Usacha-chan, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:53.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I think your older brother does the best he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:56.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Even Non...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, Non is my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.45,0:15:02.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I do my best because I want to show Non my cool points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:07.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But it doesn't always work like that, and I screw up...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But I still do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:14.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm probably not saying it very well, but... let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.52,0:15:16.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm sure Usagi-san feels the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Even if there are parts you think aren't cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,it's still part of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:32.05,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,It's hard for Usacha to understand-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.09,0:15:41.18,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha hates me now-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Usagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:46.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:48.86,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We talked to Usacha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:57.56,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Hey, Usacha-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:00.39,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Would you like to watch our concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:01.16,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:04.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll let you see my cute side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:15.34,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:20.55,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.84,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:30.96,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The pumped-up Dressing Parfait makes their challenge in a passionate rock coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.15,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Rock Style Lady Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:34.51,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.07,0:16:39.08,Default-Alt,Fan1,0,0,0,,Shion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.23,Default-Alt,Fan2,0,0,0,,Dorthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.78,Default-Alt,Fan3,0,0,0,,Leona-kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:45.24,Default-Alt,Fan4,0,0,0,,Dressing Parfait is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.46,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,They sure are popular-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:51.47,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Initially, all that team did was fight amongst themselves-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:55.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure Usagi went through a lot of trouble{hardships} to bring that team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Usagi-san sure works hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:04.56,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Lightning fast and in high spirits!{TLC - words are right, but wtf is she trying to go for}{It sounds cool, just go with it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:08.52,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We'll light a fire in your hearts to the max!{changed to not be redundant}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:11.48,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Get fired up and relax! {uhhhhh}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.35,0:17:17.44,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Perfect combustion Dressing Parfait's "No D&D Code"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!{timing}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.92,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Usagi-san, thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:33.62,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you're like,\Nthose who work hard are the cool ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.62,0:18:35.67,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you doing your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:39.54,Default,DressingPArfait,0,0,0,,Full-Speed Dash For Smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:42.27,Default,DressingPArfait,0,0,0,,Fly, balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:48.23,Default,DressingPArfait,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:55.29,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:19.57,Default-Alt,Fan,0,0,0,,Dorthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:21.56,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Nii-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:22.82,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Nii-cha...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.00,Default-Alt,Fan42,0,0,0,,You're the best, Shion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.28,Default-Alt,Fan3456,0,0,0,,I love you, Leona!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.28,Default-Alt,Fan3456,0,0,0,,{\3c&HA13EA6&}Dorthy's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.24,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Good job-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:33.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Today's concert was awesome yet again-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's throw Usagi in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.34,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:36.36,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.68,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you girls-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.68,Default-Alt,Girls,0,0,0,,Horray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:45.22,Default-Alt,Girls,0,0,0,,Horray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:39.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:45.22,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What is it-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.95,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We were able to put on a great concert because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:51.57,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:54.11,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You work harder than you should have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:55.12,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,We're in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.12,0:19:55.89,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:19:58.79,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.62,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{Usagi-san, }Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:00.67,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:02.97,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What has gotten into you girls today-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:05.33,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nii-cha is cool-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:08.54,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nii-cha is someone that Usacha can be proud of!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:09.52,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.79,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha, I'll be back-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:18.75,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Nii-cha...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:21.27,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.31,0:20:25.42,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Usacha loves Nii-cha-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:29.89,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,M-Me too! I love you, Usacha-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:31.96,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa! Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:32.85,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:35.10,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa! Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:39.31,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha! Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:41.71,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:43.78,Default,Usacha,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Nii-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:46.78,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We have a new transfer student from the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:09.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What are the Palps?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.67,0:23:12.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's a large mountain range in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:14.16,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's a princess scholarship student.
